_history_tweet_ids": ["2115688830301007993", "2115692083684188470"], "id": "2115688830301007993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "注意以下内容源自缠师，并非本人所写，因此本人不承担任何责任，也请勿对号入座。\n\n缠中说禅在《下一目标：摧毁基金》中，对基金使用了一系列带有强烈贬义和隐喻色彩的“命名”。这些称呼集中体现了他对基金结构性缺陷的判断。\n\n核心命名与含义\n“合法传销”", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2115688830301007993"}, {"author_id": "2096056678022311936", "created_at": "2026-10-28T23:15:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115583252715192412"], "id": "2115583252715192412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 1576, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "让你醍醐灌顶的一句话\n\n1、《金瓶梅》中李瓶儿跟潘金莲聊天时说：“莲妹妹，记住姐一包话，这世上的事儿，凡是禁止的，往往是有好处但不想分给你。凡是提倡的，大概率是有坑需要你去填。“瓶儿的一句话，让金莲醍醐灌顶。", "url": "https://x.com/Q9925912/status/2115583252715192412"}, {"author_id": "295762239", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:55:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115789633464438801"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54Etq-pG4_…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54Etq-pG4_t5Cf5Khy3gn9A1?pwd=jycp", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP54Etq-pG4_t5Cf5Khy3gn9A1?pwd=jycp", "url": "https://t.co/nFAFg9JPXw"}]}, "id": "2115789633464438801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 56634, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/nFAFg9JPXw\n\n《百分之五》作者：一颗松果\n《变成垂耳兔后》作者：不动茗\n《倒刺》作者：悖妄\n《福无双至》作者：墨衣绣骨\n《假面佛》作者：陌上南疆\n《渴望降生》作者：西露比sylvie\n《模特》作者：MeAtfish\n《失业小朋友》作者：作者名无所不能", "url": "https://x.com/jason_gurung/status/2115789633464438801"}, {"author_id": "1639022572418236417", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:08:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115974040813007114"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url