宁与鹤\n[更110]仙人跳时不要省车费 作者：IBrnInu\n[更102]穿进限z文里养崽躺平失败后 作者：呆宝宝\n[更96]《九尾白狐是我前世妻》作者：hugoo\n[更92]变数 作者：九木", "url": "https://x.com/liamwwfc98/status/2115977967197401109"}, {"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:22:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116083264771543181"], "id": "2116083264771543181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1: Chinese and English\n达摩多罗禅经序1\n\n达摩多罗尊者讲的一套禅修方法指南，主要是把佛祖悉达多教的安那般那（呼吸观）和不净观（比如白骨观）这些法门，按阶段一步步说清楚：怎么通过打坐禅定，慢慢打开智慧，最后走向觉悟。\n\nThis is a meditation guide taught by Master Dharmatrāta. It mainly", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2116083264771543181"}, {"author_id": "1748602031248732160", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:54:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115970643493875776"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hRiWcfFFDS", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2115970643493875776/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115969485194846208", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/hRiWcfFFDS"}, {"display_url": "x.com/_zheergen/stat…", "end": 190, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/_zheergen/status/2115821371586678974", "start": 167, "url": "https://t.co/1eIipgpoLG"}]}, "id": "2115970643493875776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 148, "impression_count": 12340, "like_count": 130, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 32}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115821371586678974", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽！缠论里最复杂的分型、笔、中枢识别，居然有人全部用 Rust 重写了，还整合了 220 多个交易信号函数！\n\nCZSC，6.5K Stars，一套专门做缠论分析和量化策略研究的 Python 工具。\n\n以前研究缠论，最麻烦的就是手动画笔、找中枢、判断买卖点，不同周期还得反复对照。 https://t.co/hRiWcfFFDS https://t.co/1eIipgpoLG", "url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2115970643493875776"}, {"author_id": "995771442523459587", "created_at": "2026-10-29T19:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115881506505699620"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zhangdajun/sta…", "end": 132, "ex